# generated run state (id8_common/expt_config.py) -- lives in state/ since
# 2026-09-06. Both patterns are unanchored, so they also catch a stale copy
# left at the repo root by an older checkout. The state/ directory itself does
# not need to exist in a checkout: expt_config.dump() mkdir -p's it.
run_state.yml
.run_state-*
